{"3972980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mirklurk: Every Step Matters", "steam_appid": 3972980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>..:: A Turn-Based Survival RPG ::..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each turn, you must make choices - Spend your Actions Points well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The swamp might overwhelm you, or harden your survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While nature itself will be a  challenge, the foes you encounter will be just as formidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat will be unique and puzzle-like.  Weapons will have different attack patterns and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nights are cold and dangerous. A well-planned camp and enough firewood will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mirk is a living place. You will create paths, set up camps, discover ancient ruins and mysteries, all while meeting unique characters and beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Focus/Tiredness, Energy and Warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with skills, abilities, and a wide variety of items, armor and gear. The survival mechanics will play a large part here as well: Your steel chestplate will be great for combat, but not for climbing or keeping warm. Skills will allow for a variety of playstyles: from foraging the land, brewing and selling potions, hunting, exploring and looting, to trading, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain, creating unique playthroughs while still integrating handcrafted location, characters and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique world with interesting lore, enemies, discoveries, and an eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice: An optional main story with a decent amount of challenges and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lastly: <i>This game is under development - details, screenshots and videos will added and/or changed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This game is meant to be <strong>challenging</strong>. You are expected to lose many times, and it will take time to learn how to survive. Dungeons will not be amusement rides designed for the player, but dangerous trials that demand careful preparation. To sum it up: <i>Warding off the darkness with your last dying torch won't be easy</i> <i>— but it should be <strong>memorable</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>..:: A Turn-Based Survival RPG ::..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each turn, you must make choices - Spend your Actions Points well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The swamp might overwhelm you, or harden your survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f944c2a2b9e3f5e2db292420951aa198.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While nature itself will be a  challenge, the foes you encounter will be just as formidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat will be unique and puzzle-like.  Weapons will have different attack patterns and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/1762aac0d0a33920e1c11977e6ac00e2.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nights are cold and dangerous. A well-planned camp and enough firewood will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/8fc413fc17a31a5347aeb952604ada46.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mirk is a living place. You will create paths, set up camps, discover ancient ruins and mysteries, all while meeting unique characters and beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.poster.avif?t=1787041980\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.webm?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/3858a29d65f5fb1de2455b2bbf33d86f.mp4?t=1787041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Focus/Tiredness, Energy and Warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with skills, abilities, and a wide variety of items, armor and gear. The survival mechanics will play a large part here as well: Your steel chestplate will be great for combat, but not for climbing or keeping warm. Skills will allow for a variety of playstyles: from foraging the land, brewing and selling potions, hunting, exploring and looting, to trading, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain, creating unique playthroughs while still integrating handcrafted location, characters and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique world with interesting lore, enemies, discoveries, and an eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice: An optional main story with a decent amount of challenges and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lastly: <i>This game is under development - details, screenshots and videos will added and/or changed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This game is meant to be <strong>challenging</strong>. You are expected to lose many times, and it will take time to learn how to survive. Dungeons will not be amusement rides designed for the player, but dangerous trials that demand careful preparation. To sum it up: <i>Warding off the darkness with your last dying torch won't be easy</i> <i>— but it should be <strong>memorable</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You've been exiled to The Mirk - an unforgiving swampland where every step could be your last. You must constantly make choices: what paths to take, which tree to shelter under, what beasts to engage or avoid, what items to bring into the darkness of dungeons, and what treasures to leave behind.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/c7a6790363e9dff712e3e820b4a278593577d4e3/header.jpg?t=1787041980", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/2eb09d138c71e4bd57320e5c346b31de036d5ba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787041980", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/2eb09d138c71e4bd57320e5c346b31de036d5ba4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787041980", "website": "https://edympixels.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 CPU m370 2.40GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Ati mobility radeon HD 5000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "This game has been made by Mattias Myde, Edym Pixels ©. It has been made with GameMaker Studio 2.", "developers": ["Edym Pixels"], "publishers": ["Edym Pixels"], "demos": [{"appid": 4328340, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1199, "final": 1199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$11.99"}, "packages": [1394977], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Mirklurk: Every Step Matters", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1394977, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Mirklurk: Every Step Matters - $11.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_f